message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Motor-Imagery-Classification: WGAN-GP Data Augmentation for MI-EEG Classification"
abstract: >-
  Code accompanying "Motor Imagery Classification Performance Enhancement with
  EEG Data Augmentation via Wasserstein Generative Adversarial Networks".
  Implements a WGAN-GP-based augmentation pipeline for BCI Competition IV 2a
  motor-imagery EEG classification, using continuous wavelet transform (CWT)
  scalograms and a CNN classifier under a leakage-controlled within-subject
  evaluation protocol.
